Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}First Arrival at Xilan Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 33
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I give that landing a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Refusing to abandon your companions—that’s your trademark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I knew all along they’d come to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My Paper Beast didn’t pick up the scent of the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The fragment is still in Green Green Grassland—that makes things easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The scales of victory are tipping in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s huge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a figure over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go after it. —Don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely mustn’t split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it’s too easy for them to impersonate us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry so much; my incomparable aura is impossible to imitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better hurry and find Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This colorful world is truly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree is divided into two main areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The upper part is the Flower Area, and the lower part is the Silt Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Each area holds a fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If we know the locations, it should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Tribe and Silt Tribe are formidable; we mustn’t alert them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First, use a fragment to enhance your abilities and disguise yourself as one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That will make it easier to locate the specific positions of the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really happy with this look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers here are huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it didn’t break; otherwise, we wouldn’t be able to pinpoint the fragments’ locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two fragments here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One is higher up and the other is lower down, but the exact locations aren’t clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll just have to try searching the general area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The drone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed up my hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped this, right? Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so dirty! Get it away—get it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was dangerous for you to suddenly rush out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who rushed over first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How come…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you look so much like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you my admirers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly am the future of the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is so narcissistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s him, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got it wrong; we aren’t your admirers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re from Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here to find something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Were you sent by the Silt Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for the Flower Baby Zone, the Silt Tribe is strictly forbidden from entering the Flower Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening? That’s not who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving like a fly—I can’t even see clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you’d compare someone as elegant and noble as me to a fly…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you’ve grown wings too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our speeds are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safer to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so fast—I can’t see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re no match for a genius of the Flower Tribe like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not going to lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you the strongest Spark of the Flower Tribe: the power of Light Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just bump into something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you! How did you get so dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s simply improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry back and take a bath and change your clothes while there’s still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I’m not…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,“No”? Don’t dawdle. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Weslie start dancing just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn’t dancing; he was telling us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Elder mistook him for someone else, so he should just play along
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and use that identity to stay here and look for the fragment in the tree
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,while telling us to go down to the tree’s base to rescue the other Weslie and find the other fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually understood all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can slide down to the base of the tree using this vine. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold steady—we’re almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,“Almost there”? Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there suddenly an earthquake here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is injured; let’s go save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The residents here all have wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I was mistaken for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s as if it’s your first time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, our Flower Tribe has toiled diligently
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to safeguard the vitality of the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we must never forget our mission and duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished with work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take a flower bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take the flower bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fresh flower bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the outfit for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua looks so handsome; he looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As a Flower Mentor, make sure you don’t be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua looks so handsome; he looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, the fragment is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It really didn’t take any
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,effort at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, may I go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As a Flower Mentor…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring a Flower Baby that possesses a Spark to enter the flower bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring a Flower Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you forgotten everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s welcome Xi Huahua back as our Flower Mentor for this term.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I’ll have to rely on this so-called Flower Baby Trial to get the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I also need to introduce a new mentor who has come from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, I am Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks just like Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with the drone’s navigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven’t we reached the village yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to go anywhere else, because this is the end of the line for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go save Mr. Slowy; I’ll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m your opponent.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
